<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>SK Kabunga-an Official App</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f8fc;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    header {
      background: #082f6b;
      color: white;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    .header-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ffd21f;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #082f6b 0%,
          #0b4fa8 45%,
          #1677e8 100%
        );

      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 75px 20px 90px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 340px;
      height: 340px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      right: -130px;
      top: -90px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero-logo {
      width: 180px;
      max-width: 55vw;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero .subtitle {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffd21f;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #edf5ff;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: #0b4fa8;
      padding: 13px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 5px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: white;
      border: 2px solid white;
    }

    /* GENERAL */
    section {
      padding: 65px 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      color: #0b4fa8;
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #64748b;
    }

    /* OFFICIAL LOGOS */
    .official-logos {
      background: white;
    }

    .logo-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .logo-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo-card {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto 15px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      padding: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(11,79,168,0.15);
      border: 2px solid #dbeafe;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .logo-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .logo-item h3 {
      color: #082f6b;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    /* ABOUT */
    .about-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border-left: 5px solid #1677e8;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);
    }

    /* FEATURES */
    .features-section {
      background: #eef5ff;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(15,23,42,0.07);
      border-top: 4px solid #1677e8;
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #0b4fa8;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    /* USER GUIDE */
    .guide {
      background: white;
    }

    .guide-box {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef5ff, #ffffff);
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(11,79,168,0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .guide-box h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #082f6b;
    }

    .coming-soon {
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #0b4fa8;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* PRIVACY */
    .privacy-section {
      background: #eef5ff;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      background: #061f46;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      padding: 42px 20px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-logos {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .footer-logos img {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      border: 2px solid white;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: white;
    }

    .footer-title {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    /* MOBILE */
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .header-container {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      nav {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 60px 20px 70px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      .hero-logo {
        width: 155px;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .logo-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 25px 15px;
      }

      .logo-card {
        width: 125px;
        height: 125px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      nav a {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .logo-card {
        width: 110px;
        height: 110px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-container">

    <div class="brand">
      <img
        src="sk-kabunga-an-logo.png"
        alt="SK Kabunga-an Official App Logo"
      >

      <span>SK Kabunga-an</span>
    </div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#logos">Logos</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#guide">User Guide</a>
      <a href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
    </nav>

  </div>
</header>


<section class="hero" id="home">

  <div class="hero-content">

    <img
      class="hero-logo"
      src="sk-kabunga-an-logo.png"
      alt="SK Kabunga-an Official App"
    >

    <h1>SK Kabunga-an Official App</h1>

    <div class="subtitle">
      Sangguniang Kabataan • Barangay Kabunga-an
    </div>

    <p>
      An offline-first management application designed to help
      Sangguniang Kabataan officials manage youth records,
      activities, projects, finances, meetings, documents,
      attendance, inventory, and other SK operations.
    </p>

    <a class="button" href="#guide">
      View User Guide
    </a>

    <a class="button button-outline" href="#features">
      Explore Features
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="official-logos" id="logos">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">

      <h2>Official Logos</h2>

      <p>
        The official identities associated with the
        SK Kabunga-an Official App.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="logo-grid">

      <div class="logo-item">

        <div class="logo-card">
          <img
            src="baybay-logo.png"
            alt="City of Baybay Logo"
          >
        </div>

        <h3>City of Baybay</h3>

      </div>


      <div class="logo-item">

        <div class="logo-card">
          <img
            src="barangay-kabunga-an-logo.png"
            alt="Barangay Kabunga-an Logo"
          >
        </div>

        <h3>Barangay Kabunga-an</h3>

      </div>


      <div class="logo-item">

        <div class="logo-card">
          <img
            src="sk-kabunga-an-seal.png"
            alt="Sangguniang Kabataan Kabunga-an Logo"
          >
        </div>

        <h3>Sangguniang Kabataan</h3>

      </div>


      <div class="logo-item">

        <div class="logo-card">
          <img
            src="sk-kabunga-an-logo.png"
            alt="SK Kabunga-an Official App Logo"
          >
        </div>

        <h3>Official App</h3>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section id="about">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">

      <h2>About the App</h2>

      <p>
        Built to make SK management simpler, organized,
        accessible, and reliable.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="about-card">

      <p>
        The SK Kabunga-an Official App is designed to assist the
        Sangguniang Kabataan of Barangay Kabunga-an in managing
        important information and day-to-day operations from an
        Android device.
      </p>

      <br>

      <p>
        The application follows an offline-first approach,
        allowing important features and records to remain
        available even without a continuous internet connection.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="features-section" id="features">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">

      <h2>App Features</h2>

      <p>
        Tools created to support the daily operations of
        SK Kabunga-an.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Youth Registry</h3>
        <p>
          Register, update, search, and manage youth information.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Finance</h3>
        <p>
          Manage budgets, allocations, expenses, and financial records.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Activities</h3>
        <p>
          Create activities, manage participants, and record attendance.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Projects</h3>
        <p>
          Organize projects, participants, expenses, and progress.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Meetings</h3>
        <p>
          Create and manage SK meeting information and schedules.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>QR Tools</h3>
        <p>
          Use QR codes for attendance and easier youth registration.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Inventory</h3>
        <p>
          Manage SK equipment, supplies, and inventory records.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Documents</h3>
        <p>
          Organize important SK documents and records.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <h3>Data Management</h3>
        <p>
          Backup, import, transfer, and manage application data.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="guide" id="guide">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">

      <h2>User Guide</h2>

      <p>
        Learn how to use each part of the
        SK Kabunga-an Official App.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="guide-box">

      <h3>Step-by-Step App Instructions</h3>

      <p>
        This section will contain screenshots and detailed
        instructions showing SK officials how to use
        each feature of the application.
      </p>

      <span class="coming-soon">
        User Guide Coming Soon
      </span>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="privacy-section" id="privacy">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">

      <h2>Privacy & Data</h2>

      <p>
        Protecting SK and youth information is an important
        part of the application.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="about-card">

      <p>
        The SK Kabunga-an Official App is designed primarily
        as an offline application. Information stored in the
        app remains on authorized devices unless an authorized
        user intentionally performs a supported data transfer,
        backup, import, or export.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<footer>

  <div class="footer-logos">

    <img
      src="baybay-logo.png"
      alt="City of Baybay"
    >

    <img
      src="barangay-kabunga-an-logo.png"
      alt="Barangay Kabunga-an"
    >

    <img
      src="sk-kabunga-an-seal.png"
      alt="Sangguniang Kabataan"
    >

    <img
      src="sk-kabunga-an-logo.png"
      alt="SK Kabunga-an Official App"
    >

  </div>

  <p class="footer-title">
    <strong>SK Kabunga-an Official App</strong>
  </p>

  <p>
    Sangguniang Kabataan of Barangay Kabunga-an
  </p>

  <br>

  <p>
    &copy; 2026 SK Kabunga-an. All rights reserved.
  </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
